WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,480
When your grandma comes home

2
00:00:01,480 --> 00:00:03,720
I found that your grandpa's body has become cold.

3
00:00:03,720 --> 00:00:04,840
No breath

4
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:06,880
I held the funeral for your grandpa on the same day.

5
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:08,760
Because your grandpa died a violent death

6
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:10,120
Can't stay at home too long

7
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:11,880
He was buried the next day

8
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:15,160
Isn't this someone's fan who was just buried?

9
00:00:15,160 --> 00:00:20,330
That Guo Chengzhong who died violently, what's going on? It's scary. Move quickly.

10
00:00:20,330 --> 00:00:21,250
Guo's wife

11
00:00:21,250 --> 00:00:22,330
Go and have a look

12
00:00:22,330 --> 00:00:23,930
There's something going on among your grandpa's fans

13
00:00:23,930 --> 00:00:26,770
Did you deceive the master?

14
00:00:26,770 --> 00:00:28,730
If you have something you can't let go of, just speak up

15
00:00:28,730 --> 00:00:30,370
You, the boss, go well

16
00:00:30,410 --> 00:00:34,100
I will bring our feet up

17
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:35,460
After your grandma finished speaking

18
00:00:35,460 --> 00:00:37,060
The powder bag still hasn’t moved.

19
00:00:37,060 --> 00:00:39,300
The group had no choice but to return the same way they came.

20
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:40,660
until the seventh day

21
00:00:40,660 --> 00:00:42,620
There is movement in the pink bag again

22
00:00:42,620 --> 00:00:44,660
Your grandma is determined this time

23
00:00:44,660 --> 00:00:45,780
Need to grind flour

24
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:47,540
But no one wants to do this

25
00:00:47,540 --> 00:01:01,960
She can only do it herself

26
00:01:01,960 --> 00:01:04,680
It's a pity that I wasn't there enough at that time

27
00:01:04,680 --> 00:01:06,760
Can't be resurrected to talk to her

28
00:01:06,760 --> 00:01:09,240
Tell her I never blamed her

29
00:01:09,240 --> 00:01:12,160
In this case, she will not die in love

30
00:01:12,160 --> 00:01:13,120
Cry softly

31
00:01:13,120 --> 00:01:14,440
Shen Haiying's body can't bear it

32
00:01:14,440 --> 00:01:15,520
What are you here for?

33
00:01:15,520 --> 00:01:17,960
My doting granddaughter has a military garden

34
00:01:17,960 --> 00:01:19,800
I'm here to be a humble king

35
00:01:19,800 --> 00:01:21,320
Then why are you making such a big fuss?

36
00:01:21,320 --> 00:01:23,020
I will give her this opportunity

37
00:01:23,020 --> 00:01:24,300
Stop looking around

38
00:01:24,300 --> 00:01:26,990
Be careful and you will be hit by the Xian family for a while.

39
00:01:26,990 --> 00:01:28,510
The fairy family behind Shen Haiying

40
00:01:28,510 --> 00:01:29,710
It was pretty good

41
00:01:29,710 --> 00:01:31,710
But she wears a crown haunted by five ghosts

42
00:01:31,710 --> 00:01:32,750
The day the church was established

43
00:01:32,750 --> 00:01:35,790
I'm afraid some shameless people will come to cause trouble. Don't worry.

44
00:01:35,790 --> 00:01:36,750
I told you

45
00:01:36,750 --> 00:01:38,230
Won't let them tremble on their own feet

46
00:01:38,230 --> 00:01:40,220
It’s time to register

47
00:01:40,220 --> 00:01:41,780
Next is the horse racing event

48
00:01:41,780 --> 00:01:44,740
Let the superiors and the underworld recognize it

49
00:01:44,740 --> 00:01:46,260
Shen Haiying established the church today

50
00:01:46,300 --> 00:01:49,990
Say hello to Nanchen and Beidou

51
00:01:49,990 --> 00:01:51,310
This hall is finally established

52
00:01:51,310 --> 00:01:52,750
As long as you stay positive in the future

53
00:01:52,750 --> 00:01:54,150
There will be no more closures
